ATS integration wrapper for ROG-Map.

The ROG-Map core sources in include/rog_map, include/super_utils,
include/fmt, and src/rog_map are derived from:
https://github.com/hku-mars/ROG-Map

Copyright 2024 Yunfan REN, MaRS Lab, University of Hong Kong.
The source headers identify the core as LGPL-3.0-or-later. This package
therefore follows LGPL-3.0-or-later despite a conflicting BSD declaration
in the local reference package.xml.

The ATS wrapper in src/ats_rog_map_node.cpp is project-specific glue code.

